    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunsmith is Unreal Engine's first and only Rollback networking plugin. Designed from the ground up to support developers in creating server-authoritative experiences, with a custom editor for fast design iteration.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the built version of the plugin, created so that the tech can be evaluated before the plugin is purchased. Test out the example weapons in the shooting range or sample the predictive netcode and dynamic attachment system in the multiplayer mode with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunsmith is still in a Beta state so this game will evolve as the plugin grows.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunsmith is Unreal Engine's first and only Rollback networking plugin. Designed from the ground up to support developers in creating server-authoritative experiences, with a custom editor for fast design iteration.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the built version of the plugin, created so that the tech can be evaluated before the plugin is purchased. Test out the example weapons in the shooting range or sample the predictive netcode and dynamic attachment system in the multiplayer mode with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunsmith is still in a Beta state so this game will evolve as the plugin grows.</p>",
